      "title": "Reassessing Prophetic Literacy and the Written Transmission of Revelation: A Linguistic and Textual Analysis of the Qurʾān",
      "section": "3.3. Q 80:13–16 — “In honored pages, in the hands of scribes”",
      "section_number": 17,
      "chunk_number": 0,
      "source_path": "research/articles/reassessing-prophetic-literacy-written-revelation.md",
