      "text": "PUIN, Gerd R. “Observations on Early Qurʾān Manuscripts in Ṣanʿāʾ.” In The Qurʾān as Text, edited by Stefan Wild, 107–12. Leiden: Brill, 1996.\n\nRYDING, Karin C. A Reference Grammar of Modern Standard Arabic. Cambridge: Cambridge University Press, 2005.\n\nṢAḤĪḤ AL-BUKHĀRĪ. Kitāb Badʾ al-Waḥy, ḥadīth no. 4953; Kitāb al-Ṣawm, ḥadīth no. 1913. Translations adapted from The Translation of the Meanings of Ṣaḥīḥ al-Bukhārī, translated by Muḥammad Muhsin Khan. Riyadh: Dār al-Salām, 1997.\n\nSADEGHI, Behnam, and GOUDARZI, Mohsen. “Ṣanʿāʾ 1 and the Origins of the Qurʾān.” Der Islam 87 (1–2) (2012): 1–129.\n\nSAHEEH INTERNATIONAL. The Qurʾān: English Translation of the Meanings and Commentary. Jeddah: Abul-Qasim Publishing House, 1997.\n\nSAMIN, Azfar, and MALIK, Bashir Ahmed. “The Qurʾān, Hadith, and the Debate on Marriageable Age: A Textual Analysis.” Al-Aasar Journal 2 (3) (2025): 1143–52. https://al-aasar.com/index.php/Journal/article/view/816/691.\n\nYUSUF ALI, ʿAbdullāh. The Meaning of the Glorious Koran: An Explanatory Translation. London: George Allen & Unwin, 1934.",
