      "title": "Reason, Revelation, and the Architecture of Truth: A Framework for Evaluating Worldviews",
      "section": "Chapter 3: Codex Mashhad (MS 18 & MS 4116) (Late 7th CE)",
      "section_number": 45,
      "chunk_number": 0,
