      "text": "Christian Bible (NT + OT) | Extensive — anonymous gospels; disputed Pauline letters; many early Christian pseudepigrapha; forgeries acknowledged by Christian scholars | Not verified — Gospels not written by their named authors; 6+ Pauline letters not by Paul; Hebrews anonymous | Not verified — Gospels not written by their named authors; 6+ Pauline letters not by Paul; Hebrews anonymous | Gospel of Thomas, Gospel of Peter, Gospel of Barnabas, Apocalypse of Peter, Shepherd of Hermas, Pastoral Epistles (disputed authorship) | Gospel of Thomas, Gospel of Peter, Gospel of Barnabas, Apocalypse of Peter, Shepherd of Hermas, Pastoral Epistles (disputed authorship) | Low — Authorship claims and historical findings diverge significantly\n\nVedas | Extensive —Multiple redactions — long oral evolution, multiple recensions (Śākala, Bāṣkala, Paippalāda); layers added over centuries | Not verifiable — No identifiable original authors; attributed to “rishis” but historically anonymous | Not verifiable — No identifiable original authors; attributed to “rishis” but historically anonymous | Brahmanas, Aranyakas, Upanishads added progressively; no stable authorial voice | Brahmanas, Aranyakas, Upanishads added progressively; no stable authorial voice | Medium–Low — High spiritual coherence but no authorial coherence claims",
