      "text": "Buddhist Canon | Multiple attributions — sutras attributed to Buddha centuries after his life; Mahayana sutras appear 400+ years later | Not verifiable — No early manuscripts; many texts openly composed by later monks but attributed to Buddha | Not verifiable — No early manuscripts; many texts openly composed by later monks but attributed to Buddha | Lotus Sutra, Heart Sutra, Diamond Sutra — post-Buddha compositions | Lotus Sutra, Heart Sutra, Diamond Sutra — post-Buddha compositions | Medium–Low — Philosophical coherence but authorship inconsistent with historical development\n\nQurʾān | None | Verified — Single speaker. | Verified — Single speaker. | None | None | High — Internal authorship claims match textual and historical reality",
